OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over algae-hit canal basin
OL,4,Aafter drowning
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn algae-prone canal basin where a
OL,7,Fmother-of-five drowned could pose a
OL,8,Frisk of further deaths, a coroner has
OL,9,Fwarned.
OL,11,FSeveral people have previously mistaken
OL,12,Fthe algae at Walsall Canal Basin for
OL,13,Fgrass or an asphalt area and stepped
OL,14,Finto the water.
OL,16,FJoanne Lees, area coroner, also raised
OL,17,Fconcerns about lighting, signage,
OL,18,Fbarriers and rescue equipment at the
OL,19,Fbasin off Wolverhampton Street.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
