OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over algae-hit canal basin
OL,4,Aafter drowning
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer report followed the death of Jody
OL,7,FBrown, 38, who died after entering the
OL,8,Fwater in the early hours of 3 May. The
OL,9,FCanal and River Trust (C&RT), which
OL,10,Flooks after the waterways, and Walsall
OL,11,FCouncil said they had worked to reduce
OL,12,Frisks around the basin.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
